    <sys:String x:Key="L.General.UiScale">UI 배율:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.General.Startup">시작</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.General.StartupNote">앱을 실행할 때 설정 창의 동작을 선택합니다.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.General.OnAppLaunch">앱 실행 시:</sys:String>
